{"meta":{"id":"cpu-tpmc","category":"it/server/capacity/cpu","title":"CPU 용량 계산 (tpmC)","subtitle":"","summary":"DB, OLTP, Batch 서버 CPU 용량 산정","tags":["cpu","tpmc","용량 산정","db","oltp"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-amber","source":"blog: calc/CalcCpuTpmc.jsx","updatedAt":"2025-02-20"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>CPU</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-02-20</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">CPU 용량 계산 (tpmC)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> DB, OLTP, Batch 서버 CPU 용량 산정</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">산정 서버 정의</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용어</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">DB<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>DataBase</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">데이터 저장 및 관리 시스템 · 기본적인 데이터 저장소</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">트랜잭션<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Transaction</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">DB에서 한 번에 처리되는 작업들의 집합</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">OLTP<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Online Transaction Processing</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">실시간 DB 트랜잭션 처리 시스템 (은행, 온라인 쇼핑몰)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Batch<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Batch Processing</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">대량의 데이터를 일괄 처리하는 시스템 (회계 및 재무 처리, 로그 분석)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">단위 정의</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용어</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">TPM-C<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Transactions Per Minute Count</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">시스템이 분당 처리하는 트랜잭션 개수 [트랜잭션 / 분]</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">TPM<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Transactions per Minute</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">분당 트랜잭션 처리 개수 [트랜잭션 / 분]</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">TPS<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Transactions Per Second</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">초당 트랜잭션 처리 개수 [트랜잭션 / 초]</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">TPT<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Transaction Processing Time</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">트랜잭션 1개 처리 시간 [시간 / 트랜잭션]</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">계산식</h2></div><div class=\"my-2 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/60 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[12px] sm:text-[13px] text-stone-800 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">필요 CPU [tpmC] = 동시 사용자 수 × 사용자당 트랜잭션 수\r\n                × 기본 tpmC 보정 × 피크타임 부하 보정 × DB 크기 보정\r\n                × 애플리케이션 구조 보정 × 애플리케이션 부하 보정\r\n                × 클러스터 보정 × 시스템 여유율</div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">블로그의 계산기(입력 폼)는 위 식으로 결과를 계산합니다. 각 항목의 값은 아래 표와 같습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">입력 항목과 보정값</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">값</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">동시 사용자 수</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">직접 입력 (기본 100)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">사용자당 트랜잭션 (작업의 복잡도)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상 5 · 중 4 · 하 3</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">기본 tpmC 보정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">동시 사용자 300 이상 1.3, 미만 1.2</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">피크타임 부하 보정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상 1.5 · 중 1.4 · 하 1.3 · 기타 1.2</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">DB 크기 보정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1 + (DB 용량 단계 × 0.1) + (DB 건수 단계 × 0.05)<br><span class='text-stone-400'>용량 단계: 1GB 미만 0 · 50GB 미만 1 · 300GB 미만 2 · 300GB 이상 3 / 건수 단계: 8백만 미만 0 · 32백만 미만 1 · 128백만 미만 2 · 256백만 미만 3 · 256백만 이상 4</span></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">애플리케이션 구조 보정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">구조(단일/2중/3중) × 응답시간(3초 미만/5초 미만/5초 이상) 조합에 따라 2.0 ~ 1.1</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">애플리케이션 부하 보정 (데이터 관리 작업)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상 2.05 · 중 1.7 · 하 1.4</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">클러스터 보정 (시스템 구성)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">다중 서버 1.4 · 단일 서버 1.0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">시스템 여유율</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.3 (30%)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">애플리케이션 구조 보정표</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">구조 \\ 응답시간</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">3초 미만</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">5초 미만</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">5초 이상</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">단일 구조</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2.0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.8</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.6</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">복합 구조(2중)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.8</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.6</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.4</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">복합 구조(3중)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.4</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.3</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">참고 자료</h2></div><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/server/capacity/cpu/assets/cpu-tpmc/x01.png\" alt=\"NCS 부록 참고 — DB 서버 CPU 산정\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">NCS 부록 참고 — DB 서버 CPU 산정</figcaption></figure><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">*참고 : LM2001020201_요구사항확인.pdf (출처 : NCS 국가직무능력표준)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/capacity/cpu/cpu-tpmc","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"capacity","title":"서버 용량 산정","path":"it/server/capacity"},{"id":"cpu","title":"CPU","path":"it/server/capacity/cpu"}],"hasImage":false}